   168	selftest checks direct permutations, compositions, carried witnesses, and
   169	unrelated seeds.  It does not canonicalize arbitrary invertible row-basis
   170	changes of (H,s), whose combination with column equivalence is the binary code
   171	equivalence problem; this limitation is explicit in the README.
