5 Using advanced collision techniques
ISD techniques have evolved [Ste88, Dum89, BLP11, MMT11, BJMM12] by ﬁrst introducing
[Ste88] collision/subset-sum techniques whose purpose is to produce for codes of rate close to1,
all codewords of some small weight, and later on by substantially improving them by using on
