codex
One final audit point: the paper’s domain-standard routine is the Walsh–Hadamard transform, while the first report only executed an exact, faster word-parallel scan of the same likelihood objective. I’m adding one real shipping-size WHT run so its wall time and operation count are measured rather than inferred; the eight-seed Gray scan remains the stronger practical control.
